&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Team up with embedded, cloud, and hardware folks to bring connected products to life end-to-end&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;font-claude-response-body whitespace-normal break-words pl-2&quot;&gt;Architect full-stack systems that get mobile apps, cloud services, and devices talking to each other seamlessly&lt;/li&gt;
